    "title": "Atomic configuration replacement loses the service-readable group in both activation and rollback",
    "sourceCause": "activate saves bytes and mode only. config_write creates a new root-run temporary file through wx, applies chmod, and replaces node.json without preserving its uid/gid. Both the normal switch and rollback call that function. Restoring identical bytes and mode therefore does not restore service access.",
